# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tracked vs. local. Source, configs, datasets small enough to review, and the
# evaluation baseline are tracked. Model weights, the knowledge base, its
# vectors, and archived run history are local-only: they move via the Hugging
# Face repos, never through git. See docs/WORKSPACE.md.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
pipeline/__pycache__/

# Secrets. The glob is deliberately wide: editors and shells write sidecars
# (.env.save, .env.local, .env.bak) that would otherwise land outside .env.
.env
.env*

# Tooling state
.claude/settings.local.json
.cache/

# Model artifacts — published on the Hub, never committed
*.gguf
*.safetensors
camus-*-merged/
camus_sft_merged/
camus_final_hf/
*.BACKUP.*
*.partial.*

# LoRA adapter weights (keep the folder's README + configs, ignore the binaries)
adapters/*
!adapters/README.md
!adapters/adapter_config.json
!adapters/tokenizer_config.json
!adapters/chat_template.jinja

# Knowledge base + embedding vectors: derived, large, and built from
# copyrighted sources. Both live untracked at the repo root.
*.npy
/camus_kb*.jsonl
/camus_kb_vectors*.npy
*.ollama.npy
data/camus_kb_full.jsonl
data/camus_kb_vectors.npy
data/source_chunks.jsonl
data/kb_extracted.jsonl
*.pdf

# A second vector file in the llama.cpp embedding family is kept beside the
# live one for reference by the hosted Space. The local stack must never load
# it; covered by *.npy above, named here so the intent is explicit.
camus_kb_vectors.llamacpp.npy

# NOTE: the six training-corpus files (data/camus_*.jsonl) ARE tracked on purpose.
# If you'd rather not publish the corpus, add this line:  # data/camus_*.jsonl

# Local reference material and superseded run history — never published.
archive/
eval/archive/
data/archive/

# Inbound transfer bundles must never be committed.
mac_transfer*
*.zip

# Local-only working notes.
MISSING.md

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
